{"id": "h3_chart_26_other_server_same_patient_id", "round": "h3", "class": "The second order's subject is a URL on another server ending in Patient/p1. The reader treats any http or https URL ending in the patient id as the same patient.", "request": "{\"output\": \"Take {{drug:m1}} {{dose:m1}} {{route:m1}} {{frequency:m1}}. Take {{drug:m2}} {{dose:m2}} {{route:m2}} {{frequency:m2}}.\", \"patient\": \"p1\", \"medicationRequests\": [{\"resourceType\": \"MedicationRequest\", \"id\": \"m1\", \"status\": \"active\", \"intent\": \"order\", \"medicationCodeableConcept\": {\"text\": \"Metformin\"}, \"subject\": {\"reference\": \"Patient/p1\"}, \"dosageInstruction\": [{\"timing\": {\"repeat\": {\"frequency\": 2, \"period\": 1, \"periodUnit\": \"d\"}}, \"route\": {\"coding\": [{\"system\": \"http://snomed.info/sct\", \"code\": \"26643006\"}]}, \"doseAndRate\": [{\"doseQuantity\": {\"value\": 500, \"unit\": \"mg\", \"system\": \"http://unitsofmeasure.org\", \"code\": \"mg\"}}]}]}, {\"resourceType\": \"MedicationRequest\", \"id\": \"m2\", \"status\": \"active\", \"intent\": \"order\", \"medicationCodeableConcept\": {\"text\": \"Lisinopril\"}, \"subject\": {\"reference\": \"https://other-hospital.example/fhir/Patient/p1\"}, \"dosageInstruction\": [{\"timing\": {\"repeat\": {\"frequency\": 1, \"period\": 1, \"periodUnit\": \"d\"}}, \"route\": {\"coding\": [{\"system\": \"http://snomed.info/sct\", \"code\": \"26643006\"}]}, \"doseAndRate\": [{\"doseQuantity\": {\"value\": 10, \"unit\": \"mg\", \"system\": \"http://unitsofmeasure.org\", \"code\": \"mg\"}}]}]}]}"}
{"id": "h3_chart_27_synonym_paracetamol_acetaminophen", "round": "h3", "class": "One ingredient under two names with no shared token (Paracetamol and Acetaminophen), both active at different doses.", "request": "{\"output\": \"Take {{drug:m1}} {{dose:m1}} {{route:m1}} {{frequency:m1}}. Take {{drug:m2}} {{dose:m2}} {{route:m2}} {{frequency:m2}}.\", \"medicationRequests\": [{\"resourceType\": \"MedicationRequest\", \"id\": \"m1\", \"status\": \"active\", \"intent\": \"order\", \"medicationCodeableConcept\": {\"text\": \"Paracetamol\"}, \"subject\": {\"reference\": \"Patient/p1\"}, \"dosageInstruction\": [{\"timing\": {\"repeat\": {\"frequency\": 1, \"period\": 6, \"periodUnit\": \"h\"}}, \"route\": {\"coding\": [{\"system\": \"http://snomed.info/sct\", \"code\": \"26643006\"}]}, \"doseAndRate\": [{\"doseQuantity\": {\"value\": 500, \"unit\": \"mg\", \"system\": \"http://unitsofmeasure.org\", \"code\": \"mg\"}}]}]}, {\"resourceType\": \"MedicationRequest\", \"id\": \"m2\", \"status\": \"active\", \"intent\": \"order\", \"medicationCodeableConcept\": {\"text\": \"Acetaminophen\"}, \"subject\": {\"reference\": \"Patient/p1\"}, \"dosageInstruction\": [{\"timing\": {\"repeat\": {\"frequency\": 1, \"period\": 1, \"periodUnit\": \"d\"}}, \"route\": {\"coding\": [{\"system\": \"http://snomed.info/sct\", \"code\": \"26643006\"}]}, \"doseAndRate\": [{\"doseQuantity\": {\"value\": 500, \"unit\": \"mg\", \"system\": \"http://unitsofmeasure.org\", \"code\": \"mg\"}}]}]}]}"}
{"id": "h3_chart_28_display_frequency_conflict_metformin", "round": "h3", "class": "Display text states a different regimen (1000 mg twice a day) than the structured order (500 mg once a day). The reader does not read the display beyond the name prefix.", "request": "{\"output\": \"Take {{drug:m1}} {{dose:m1}} {{route:m1}} {{frequency:m1}}.\", \"medicationRequests\": [{\"resourceType\": \"MedicationRequest\", \"id\": \"m1\", \"status\": \"active\", \"intent\": \"order\", \"medicationCodeableConcept\": {\"text\": \"Metformin\", \"coding\": [{\"system\": \"http://www.nlm.nih.gov/research/umls/rxnorm\", \"display\": \"Metformin 1000 mg twice a day\"}]}, \"subject\": {\"reference\": \"Patient/p1\"}, \"dosageInstruction\": [{\"timing\": {\"repeat\": {\"frequency\": 1, \"period\": 1, \"periodUnit\": \"d\"}}, \"route\": {\"coding\": [{\"system\": \"http://snomed.info/sct\", \"code\": \"26643006\"}]}, \"doseAndRate\": [{\"doseQuantity\": {\"value\": 500, \"unit\": \"mg\", \"system\": \"http://unitsofmeasure.org\", \"code\": \"mg\"}}]}]}]}"}
{"id": "h3_chart_29_control_display_not_prefix_hold", "round": "h3", "class": "Control. The display does not begin with the text name (Coumadin against Warfarin), so the drug name is empty and the output should be blocked.", "request": "{\"output\": \"Take {{drug:m1}} {{dose:m1}} {{route:m1}} {{frequency:m1}}.\", \"medicationRequests\": [{\"resourceType\": \"MedicationRequest\", \"id\": \"m1\", \"status\": \"active\", \"intent\": \"order\", \"medicationCodeableConcept\": {\"text\": \"Warfarin\", \"coding\": [{\"system\": \"http://www.nlm.nih.gov/research/umls/rxnorm\", \"display\": \"Coumadin, hold if INR above 3\"}]}, \"subject\": {\"reference\": \"Patient/p1\"}, \"dosageInstruction\": [{\"timing\": {\"repeat\": {\"frequency\": 1, \"period\": 1, \"periodUnit\": \"d\"}}, \"route\": {\"coding\": [{\"system\": \"http://snomed.info/sct\", \"code\": \"26643006\"}]}, \"doseAndRate\": [{\"doseQuantity\": {\"value\": 5, \"unit\": \"mg\", \"system\": \"http://unitsofmeasure.org\", \"code\": \"mg\"}}]}]}]}"}
{"id": "h3_chart_30_control_name_weekly_methotrexate", "round": "h3", "class": "Control. The drug name contains weekly, which the frequency list blocks, so the output should be blocked.", "request": "{\"output\": \"Take {{drug:m1}} {{dose:m1}} {{route:m1}} {{frequency:m1}}.\", \"medicationRequests\": [{\"resourceType\": \"MedicationRequest\", \"id\": \"m1\", \"status\": \"active\", \"intent\": \"order\", \"medicationCodeableConcept\": {\"text\": \"Methotrexate weekly\"}, \"subject\": {\"reference\": \"Patient/p1\"}, \"dosageInstruction\": [{\"timing\": {\"repeat\": {\"frequency\": 1, \"period\": 1, \"periodUnit\": \"d\"}}, \"route\": {\"coding\": [{\"system\": \"http://snomed.info/sct\", \"code\": \"26643006\"}]}, \"doseAndRate\": [{\"doseQuantity\": {\"value\": 15, \"unit\": \"mg\", \"system\": \"http://unitsofmeasure.org\", \"code\": \"mg\"}}]}]}]}"}
